We confirm that Blue Harbor can proceed with DIS arbitration, seat Hamburg, three arbitrators and English as the language of the proceedings. The governing-law clause remains England and Wales. Please retain the right of either party to seek interim relief from a competent state court without waiving the arbitration agreement.

